# S06-T10: Agent Factory + Env Gate + UI Badge

## Objective

Centralize mock/llm selection; persist `kind` on `wc_agents`; show mock/llm badge in UI (S06 §7–8).

## App-agent preflight (MANDATORY before code)

- [ ] Run MCP preflight per `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md` §2 — **warn user if :3000 down**
- [ ] `explain("work-control")` + `explain("integrations")`
- [ ] Read `server/agents/propose.ts`, `run.ts`, `organization/app/app.config.ts` agents block

## Implementation (app-agent conventions)

- [ ] `server/agents/factory.ts` (or extend existing): `validateIntegrations()` → llm | mock
- [ ] On agent assignment, set `wc_agents.kind`; expose in API for UI
- [ ] UI: badge on epic/board/task surfaces (Nuxt UI token; no hardcoded role list)
- [ ] Boot without `AI_PROVIDER_*` — app starts, mocks active, no error spam
- [ ] Wire T07–T09 agents through factory

## Done when (app-agent)

- [ ] With env set → `kind: llm`; without → `kind: mock`; UI reflects both
- [ ] `bun run test`, `feature:health`, eslint clean on work-control

## Out

`server/agents/factory.ts`, API fields, UI badge component(s)
